Error [E0308]: Bare `None` needs a known optional type here
  --> tests/ui/null_needs_type.jet:2:10
    |
  2 |     x :: None
    |          ^^^^
 Why: `None` only fits where a `T?` is expected (S32)
 Fix: Write the optional type on the value, for example `Int?{None}`, or use `None` where a `T?` is already expected
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0308
